{"content": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>毛泽东 · 伟大领袖和导师</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Cpolygon fill='%23DE2910' points='16,2 20.12,12.47 31.51,12.47 22.2,18.94 25.64,29.53 16,22.9 6.36,29.53 9.8,18.94 0.49,12.47 11.88,12.47'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #241a10;
      --ink-soft: #5a4a35;
      --paper: #f6efe1;
      --paper-dark: #ece2d0;
      --accent: #9b1b1b;
      --accent-deep: #6e1210;
      --gold: #c9a227;
      --gold-soft: #e8ce8c;
      --white: #fffdf7;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    html, body {
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: "Songti SC", "STSong", "SimSun", "Kaiti SC", "KaiTi", Georgia, serif;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    body { padding-top: 0; }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }

    /* ===== 导航 ===== */
    .nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(246,239,225,0.94); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,0.18);
      padding: 12px 0;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .nav-brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .nav-brand svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 26px; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: color .2s; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .nav-links { display: none; } }

    /* ===== 英雄区 ===== */
    .hero {
      position: relative; min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      text-align: center; padding: 100px 20px 60px; overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #6e1210 0%, #9b1b1b 35%, #7a1614 60%, #4d0d0b 100%);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .14;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 28%, #fff 0, transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 18%, var(--gold) 0, transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, #fff 0, transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 28% 82%, var(--gold) 0, transparent 23%);
    }
    .star-deco { position: absolute; opacity: .15; pointer-events: none; }
    .star-deco.s1 { top: 12%; left: 9%; animation: pulse 3.5s infinite; }
    .star-deco.s2 { bottom: 16%; right: 8%; animation: pulse 4.5s infinite; }
    .star-deco.s3 { top: 28%; right: 20%; animation: pulse 5s infinite; transform: scale(.6); }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:.12} 50%{opacity:.22} }

    .hero-seal {
      width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); border: 2px solid rgba(232,206,140,.5);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 26px; box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201,162,39,.25);
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(46px, 7vw, 76px); font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;
      text-shadow: 2px 3px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    }
    .hero-sub {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 22px;
      margin: 12px 0 30px;
    }
    .hero-sub .line { width: 54px; height: 1px; background: rgba(232,206,140,.7); }
    .hero-sub span { color: var(--gold-soft); letter-spacing: 6px; font-size: 17px; }
    .hero-tag {
      max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 44px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); font-size: clamp(15px, 2.2vw, 19px);
      line-height: 2.1; letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .hero-btn {
      display: inline-block; padding: 13px 40px; border-radius: 40px;
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--accent-deep);
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.25); transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    }
    .hero-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
    .hero-scroll { position: absolute; bottom: 28px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); font-size: 22px; animation: bounce 2s infinite; }
    @keyframes bounce { 0%,100%{transform:translate(-50%,0)} 50%{transform:translate(-50%,8px)} }

    /* ===== 通用节结构 ===== */
    .section { padding: 90px 20px; }
    .section-alt { background: var(--paper-dark); }
    .container { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .sec-head { margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .sec-head .sec-no {
      font-size: 58px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);
      opacity: .18; line-height: 1; display: block; font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }
    .sec-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 34px); color: var(--accent-deep);
      letter-spacing: 3px; margin-top: -6px;
    }
    .sec-head .sec-sub { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; margin-top: 4px; }
    .sec-rule { width: 90px; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; margin-top: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent); }

    /* ===== 概述卡片 ===== */
    .over-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr)); gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .ov-card {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,.14);
      border-radius: 6px; padding: 26px; transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;
    }
    .ov-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.12); }
    .ov-card .ico {
      width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(155,27,27,.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .ov-card h3 { font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent-deep); margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .ov-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #5c5140; }

    .stat-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .stat {
      text-align: center; padding: 24px 10px;
      background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,.2); border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .stat .num { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1.1; }
    .stat .lbl { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 4px; }

    /* ===== 时间线 ===== */
    .tl-wrap { position: relative; }
    .tl-axis { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--accent) 8%, var(--accent) 92%, transparent); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .tl-axis { left: 16px; transform: none; } }

    .tl-era { margin-bottom: 56px; position: relative; }
    .tl-era-badge {
      position: relative; z-index: 2; margin: 0 auto 26px; width: fit-content;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,.18);
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08); border-radius: 40px; padding: 8px 24px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .tl-era-badge { margin-left: 44px; } }
    .tl-era-badge .emoji { font-size: 20px; }
    .tl-era-badge .name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-deep); letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .tl-era-badge .years { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; }

    .tl-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .tl-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-left: 44px; } }
    .tl-card {
      position: relative; z-index: 1; background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 20px 22px; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
      transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;
    }
    .tl-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.12); }
    .tl-card .y {
      display: inline-block; padding: 2px 12px; border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;
      background: rgba(155,27,27,.1); color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .tl-card h4 { font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent-deep); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .tl-card p { font-size: 13.5px; color: #5c5140; }
    .tl-card.dark { border-left-color: var(--gold); }
    .tl-card.dark .y { background: rgba(201,162,39,.15); color: #8a6d1c; }
    .tl-card.dark h4 { color: #6e5a12; }

    /* ===== 语录 ===== */
    .quote-stage {
      position: relative; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,.1);
      border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 10px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
      padding: 60px 44px 50px; text-align: center; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .quote-stage .bq { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 90px; position: absolute;
      top: 6px; left: 24px; opacity: .1; color: var(--accent); }
    .quote-stage .bq2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 90px; position: absolute;
      bottom: 10px; right: 24px; opacity: .1; color: var(--accent); transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .quote-stage .tl-gold {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 120px; height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    }
    .quote-text {
      font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 27px); color: var(--accent-deep);
      line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 18px; min-height: 96px;
      transition: opacity .5s, transform .5s;
    }
    .quote-text.fade { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    .quote-ctx { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .quote-dots { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 30px; }
    .quote-dots button {
      width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      background: #d5c9b2; transition: background .2s, transform .2s;
    }
    .quote-dots button.active { background: var(--accent); transform: scale(1.25); }

    .quote-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .quote-item {
      background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,.1); border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 16px 18px; transition: background .2s, border-color .2s;
    }
    .quote-item:hover { background: var(--white); border-color: var(--accent); }
    .quote-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-deep); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .quote-item small { font-size: 12px; color: #a08d70; }

    /* ===== 评价 ===== */
    .legacy-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(290px,1fr)); gap: 22px; }
    .leg-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.07); padding: 30px;
      transition: transform .25s;
    }
    .leg-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .leg-card h3 {
      color: var(--accent-deep); padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(155,27,27,.15); font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .leg-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #5c5140; line-height: 2; }

    /* ===== 页脚 ===== */
    footer {
      background: #4d0d0b; color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      padding: 52px 20px; text-align: center;
    }
    footer .foot-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    footer .foot-brand span { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 5px; }
    footer p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); line-height: 2; }
    footer svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ===== 导航 ===== -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <div class="nav-brand" onclick="scrollTo('hero')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="#DE2910"><polygon points="16,2 20.12,12.47 31.51,12.47 22.2,18.94 25.64,29.53 16,22.9 6.36,29.53 9.8,18.94 0.49,12.47 11.88,12.47"/></svg>
        毛泽东
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a onclick="scrollTo('overview')">生平概述</a>
        <a onclick="scrollTo('timeline')">光辉历程</a>
        <a onclick="scrollTo('quotes')">经典语录</a>
        <a onclick="scrollTo('legacy')">历史评价</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ===== 英雄区 ===== -->
  <section class="hero" id="hero">
    <svg class="star-deco s1" width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="#c9a227"><polygon points="16,2 20.12,12.47 31.51,12.47 22.2,18.94 25.64,29.53 16,22.9 6.36,29.53 9.8,18.94 0.49,12.47 11.88,12.47"/></svg>
    <svg class="star-deco s2" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="#c9a227"><polygon points="16,2 20.12,12.47 31.51,12.47 22.2,18.94 25.64,29.53 16,22.9 6.36,29.53 9.8,18.94 0.49,12.47 11.88,12.47"/></svg>
    <svg class="star-deco s3" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="#fff"><polygon points="16,2 20.12,12.47 31.51,12.47 22.2,18.94 25.64,29.53 16,22.9 6.36,29.53 9.8,18.94 0.49,12.47 11.88,12.47"/></svg>

    <div class="hero-seal">⭐</div>
    <h1>毛泽东</h1>
    <div class="hero-sub">
      <div class="line"></div>
      <span>1893 — 1976</span>
      <div class="line"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-tag">
      伟大的无产阶级革命家、战略家、理论家<br class="hide-sm"/>
      中国共产党、中国人民解放军、中华人民共和国的主要缔造者
    </p>
    <a class="hero-btn" onclick="scrollTo('overview')">走进伟人生平</a>
    <div class="hero-scroll">↓</div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== 生平概述 ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="overview">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-no">01</span>
        <h2>生平概述</h2>
        <div class="sec-sub">伟大的领袖和导师 · 人民的光荣</div>
        <div class="sec-rule"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="over-grid">
        <div class="ov-card">
          <div class="ico">🧭</div>
          <h3>革命的一生</h3>
          <p>从韶山冲农家少年到天安门城楼伟人，毛泽东始终与中国革命的成败进退紧密相连。他领导人民经过二十八年艰苦卓绝的斗争，推翻了三座大山，建立了新中国。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-card">
          <div class="ico">✒️</div>
          <h3>理论大家</h3>
          <p>毛泽东思想是马克思列宁主义基本原理与中国革命具体实践相结合的产物。《矛盾论》《实践论》《论持久战》等著作，为党和国家提供了科学的世界观和方法论。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-card">
          <div class="ico">🎭</div>
          <h3>诗书大家</h3>
          <p>“北国风光，千里冰封。”“数风流人物，还看今朝。”毛泽东诗词气势磅礴、意境深远，既是革命浪漫主义，又是壮丽现实诗篇。其书法笔走龙蛇，世称“毛体”。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-card">
          <div class="ico">🌏</div>
          <h3>世界伟人</h3>
          <p>他是国际共产主义运动杰出代表。提出“三个世界”划分理论，开辟新中国独立自主外交道路，为世界和平发展作出重大贡献，在国际上享有崇高威望。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">83</div><div class="lbl">享年</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">56</div><div class="lbl">革命生涯（年）</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">10+</div><div class="lbl">主要著作</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">67</div><div class="lbl">诗词佳作</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== 光辉历程 ===== -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="timeline">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-no">02</span>
        <h2>光辉历程</h2>
        <div class="sec-sub">探索民族复兴的壮丽征程</div>
        <div class="sec-rule"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tl-wrap">
        <div class="tl-axis"></div>

        <div class="tl-era">
          <div class="tl-era-badge">
            <span class="emoji">🌱</span>
            <span class="name">早年岁月</span>
            <span class="years">1893 — 1910</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-cards">
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1893年</span><h4>出生于韶山</h4><p>12月26日出生于湖南省湘潭县韶山冲一个农民家庭。父亲毛贻昌务农兼经商，母亲文七妹贤惠善良，对少年毛泽东影响深远。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1902年</span><h4>入私塾启蒙</h4><p>先后在韶山六处私塾读书，接受传统儒学教育，尤爱《水浒传》《三国演义》《史记》等古典名作，博闻强识、勤思好问。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1910年</span><h4>走出韶山冲</h4><p>秋天离开韶山就读湘乡东山高等小学堂，接触新学，眼界大开。临行改写诗句言志：“孩儿立志出乡关，学不成名誓不还。”自此开启救国救民的求索之路。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-era">
          <div class="tl-era-badge">
            <span class="emoji">📚</span>
            <span class="name">求索与觉醒</span>
            <span class="years">1911 — 1920</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-cards">
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1911年</span><h4>投身辛亥革命</h4><p>辛亥革命爆发后参加湖南新军，当了半年士兵。退伍后考取湖南省立第一师范学校，师从杨昌济等进步教员。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1918年</span><h4>组织新民学会</h4><p>与蔡和森等发起成立新民学会，立志“改造中国与世界”。“恰同学少年，风华正茂；书生意气，挥斥方遒。”</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1918年</span><h4>初赴北京</h4><p>经杨昌济介绍到北京大学图书馆任助理员，结识李大钊、陈独秀等，在五四新文化浪潮中开始接触并研究马克思主义。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1920年</span><h4>确立信仰</h4><p>在湖南创办文化书社、俄罗斯研究会，阅读《共产党宣言》，自此确立对马克思主义的信仰，终生未曾动摇。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-era">
          <div class="tl-era-badge">
            <span class="emoji">⚔️</span>
            <span class="name">建党与革命</span>
            <span class="years">1921 — 1934</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-cards">
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1921年</span><h4>参加中共一大</h4><p>7月出席中国共产党第一次全国代表大会，参与创建中国共产党，是中国共产党的主要创始人之一。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1927年</span><h4>秋收起义</h4><p>9月领导湘赣边界秋收起义，创建工农革命军第一军第一师，率部上井冈山，开辟“农村包围城市、武装夺取政权”的革命道路。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1929年</span><h4>古田会议</h4><p>12月主持召开古田会议，确立思想建党、政治建军原则，解决了党对军队绝对领导这一带根本性的重大问题。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1934年</span><h4>长征开始</h4><p>第五次反“围剿”失败后，中央红军被迫战略转移，毛泽东虽身处逆境，仍在遵义会议上力挽狂澜。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-era">
          <div class="tl-era-badge">
            <span class="emoji">🏔️</span>
            <span class="name">抗战与建国</span>
            <span class="years">1935 — 1949</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-cards">
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1935年</span><h4>遵义会议</h4><p>1月出席遵义会议，事实上确立了在党中央和红军的领导地位，挽救了党、挽救了红军、挽救了中国革命。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1936年</span><h4>胜利到达陕北</h4><p>红军长征胜利结束。此后在延安生活十三年，领导抗日战争。1937年写就《论持久战》等名著。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1945年</span><h4>中共七大</h4><p>4月主持中共七大，确立毛泽东思想为党的指导思想。抗战胜利后，亲赴重庆与国民党谈判，展现大智大勇。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1949年</span><h4>开国大典</h4><p>10月1日在天安门城楼庄严宣告：“中华人民共和国中央人民政府今天成立了！”中国人民从此站起来了。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-era">
          <div class="tl-era-badge">
            <span class="emoji">🏗️</span>
            <span class="name">建设新中国</span>
            <span class="years">1949 — 1966</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-cards">
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1949年</span><h4>领导建国大业</h4><p>担任中央人民政府主席，领导制定《共同纲领》，进行土地改革、抗美援朝、恢复国民经济等重大历史进程。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1956年</span><h4>中共八大</h4><p>主持召开中共八大，提出把工作重心转向经济建设，探索适合中国国情的社会主义建设道路。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1958年</span><h4>视察大江南北</h4><p>多次深入工厂农村调查研究，关心人民群众生产生活。1963年题词号召“向雷锋同志学习”，成为时代精神标杆。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1964年</span><h4>两弹一星决策</h4><p>立足长远，做出发展原子弹、氢弹和人造卫星的战略决策，为中国国防与科技事业作出不可磨灭的贡献。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-era">
          <div class="tl-era-badge">
            <span class="emoji">🌅</span>
            <span class="name">晚年岁月</span>
            <span class="years">1966 — 1976</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-cards">
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1970年</span><h4>日理万机</h4><p>虽年事已高，仍坚持主持党和国家日常工作，会见各国政要，关怀国家长治久安和人民幸福。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card"><span class="y">1971年</span><h4>乒乓外交</h4><p>亲自决策“乒乓外交”推动中美关系正常化。1972年会晤美国总统尼克松，开启中美合作新局面。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1974年</span><h4>三个世界理论</h4><p>提出“三个世界”划分，推动中国恢复联合国合法席位，确立新中国独立自主、团结反霸的和平外交方针。</p></div>
            <div class="tl-card dark"><span class="y">1976年</span><h4>巨星陨落</h4><p>9月9日在北京逝世，享年83岁。他留下了伟大的毛泽东思想，为中华民族的伟大复兴奠定了坚实基础。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== 经典语录 ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="quotes">
    <div class="container">
